From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SnowBall Contributors <dev@snowballmc.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Scope hopper event and update state to each transfer

Resolve policy from the source world and retain event short-circuit state
only in the active transfer. Suppress duplicate change notifications only
on the block entity receiving the slot write; restore the flag on exit.
This prerequisite does not enable parallel world ticks.

